#pragma once

// ---- IconsFont: every hand-drawn resident icon, in supplementary private-use plane 16
// (U+100000..). ⚠️ It used to own the C1 control block 0x7F..0xA0, which filled up (34
// glyphs) and had two neighbours it must not touch: 0xA1 is ¡ and 0x7F/0xA0 are DEL
// and NBSP. Plane 16 is empty of any generated font — the BMP private-use area holds
// the pack's flags, matras and glyph-script blocks, plane 15 the larger legend sizes —
// so the font can grow without shadowing anything. U+100000..U+100003 are the icons
// added in round 41-43; the old C1 glyphs follow IN THEIR OLD ORDER from U+100004, so
// new = 0x100004 + (old - 0x7F).
//
// ⚠️ IconsFont stays g_all_fonts[0] (fonts.yaml prepend_fonts): its yAdvance 40 is the
// baseline every other font is aligned to (kdisp_write_gfx_char shifts a glyph by
// font->yAdvance - fonts[0]->yAdvance), and its position is what every pack font's
// stored gidx counts from. Moving its RANGE changes neither.
//
// ⚠️ Label each bitmap with a BLOCK comment, never //: the host's header parser
// (PolyKybdHost tools/gfx_font.py) strips only block comments inside a bitmap, so a
// // line's "0x100000" is read as a data byte.
